7. Error handling demonstrations:
--------------------------------------------------
  Missing value:
    JSON parse error at line 1, column 9: Unexpected token: }
  near: "...

  Missing colon:
    JSON parse error at line 1, column 8: Expected ':', got 'value'
  n...

  Trailing comma:
    JSON parse error at line 1, column 10: Trailing comma not allowed i...

  Unterminated string:
    JSON parse error at line 1, column 1: Unterminated string
  near: "...

  Invalid escape:
    JSON parse error at line 1, column 11: Invalid escape sequence: \z
...

  Invalid number:
    JSON parse error at line 1, column 14: Unexpected character: '.'
  ...

  Invalid literal:
    JSON parse error at line 1, column 1: Unexpected character: 'u'
  n...

